    {
      "field": "accessibility.notes",
      "value": "The main entrance is reached by 15 steps from Geffrye Street, and a ramp in four sections also serves it. The Kingsland Road gates have ramps, except the south gate. Manual wheelchairs can be borrowed on the day, not booked. The first-floor Collections Display needs staff help to reach. Free sensory kit and ear-defenders from Reception. Some temporary shows have flashing lights, with warning signs.",
      "source_date": "2026-07-31",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "fields": [
            "accessibility.notes"
          ],
